OL,3,GNEWSATriple tower block demolition plan
OL,4,Ato be submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to demolish a city's three tower
OL,7,Fblocks are to be submitted as a housing
OL,8,Ffirm says only one resident still needs
OL,9,Fto be rehoused.
OL,11,FThe Lambton, Londonderry and Lumley
OL,12,FTowers, or 3Ls, in Sunderland's East
OL,13,FEnd have been earmarked for demolition
OL,14,Fby housing association Gentoo as part
OL,15,Fof a drive to avoid large repair costs.
OL,17,FStructural investigations started on
OL,18,Fthe 3Ls'in November 2023, with Gentoo
OL,19,Fdeciding in August last year to take
OL,20,Fthe demolition option at a cost of
OL,21,F#2.6m per tower.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
