OL,3,GNEWSATriple tower block demolition plan
OL,4,Ato be submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company confirmed on Tuesday that
OL,7,Fjust one resident had not yet found a
OL,8,Fsuitable new home and was being
OL,9,Fsupported to move "when the time is
OL,10,Fright for them".
